<title>UK: Ecuador prices $350 million five-year Eurobond.</title>
<headline>Ecuador prices $350 million five-year Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ecuador has priced the five-year</p>
<p>fixed rate tranche of its two-tranche debut Eurobond, lead</p>
<p>manager Chase said on Friday.</p>
<p>    * * * * *  AMT	  $350 MLN  COUPON     11.25</p>
<p>MATURITY 25.APR.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.40     PAY DATE    25.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  70 BP     REOFFER    99.40     SPREAD	+470 BP</p>
<p> MGT/UND    20 BP     SELL CONC  50 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND FIVE-YEAR U.S TREASURY</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX/ECUAD DENOMS (K) *	   GOVA LAW    N.Y</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> NOTES	*1K (REGS), 250-1M (144A)</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
